if (!roadByKey.has(startKey)) return null;
```

If the citizen is inside the farm (not on a road), the path back would fail and the citizen would be stuck.

So I need to handle the return path differently. When the citizen finishes working and needs to go home, I should place them back on the adjacent road tile before pathfinding.

